@base = http://localhost:5105
@alice = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@bob = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Open an account (201)
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Chloe", "initialDeposit": 50 }

### Validation specific to the slice (400, ValidationProblem)
POST {{base}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "", "initialDeposit": 1 }

### Withdraw 100 €
POST {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Transfer from Alice to Bob
POST {{base}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "source": "{{alice}}", "target": "{{bob}}", "amount": 250 }

### Get Alice, with her latest operations
GET {{base}}/accounts/{{alice}}
